{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>TVB熱播劇《死有對証》推出全新3集番外篇小劇場《強迫症的一天》！繼辦公室的茶杯大戰後，今次「法醫二人組」陳曉華（飾程芷昕）與毒舌上司韋家雄（飾林琛）的戰場直接轉移到茶水間的雪櫃內。面對不按常理出牌的韋家雄，陳曉華再度上演了一幕令人哭笑不得的爆笑互動。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_7032b0f81f69fa6b-414\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>劇中一開場，患有強迫症的陳曉華一打開雪櫃，「執位魂」便瞬間大爆发，嚴格將雪櫃內各款飲品分門別類排好：「茶嘅放呢邊，跟住可樂對返正，之後咖啡……搞掂！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_7032b0f81f69fa6b-415\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>正當她欣賞成果之際，上司韋家雄卻突然亂入，更隨手將剛買的兩瓶特價飲品隨意塞進雪櫃，邊放邊唸唸有詞：「特價買嘅放呢度，咁我知特價買啦！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_7032b0f81f69fa6b-415\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"91457623-0002-4b3b-bce4-316950a84836.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026a8VWW310uH1789526879.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"91457623-0002-4b3b-bce4-316950a84836.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7020d3dd-e2e1-4789-bb88-cc73dc0fa6f1.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026m7obSFybk41789526879.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7020d3dd-e2e1-4789-bb88-cc73dc0fa6f1.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_7032b0f81f69fa6b-416\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>看見自己辛苦排好的整齊隊形被無情破壞，陳曉華即時出手制止，並親自動手將飲品歸位：「林醫生！茶呢，應該放呢邊，咁樣先啱嘅！」 隨後，韋家雄亦堅持己見，兩人就在雪櫃前上演了一場你挪我移的「攻防戰」。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_7032b0f81f69fa6b-417\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>最終，韋家雄的耐性徹底歸零，一句「OK，有方法！」竟直接把雪櫃中排得整整齊齊的飲品全部推倒：「咁咪唔亂囉！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_7032b0f81f69fa6b-417\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a5e84c49-c5a4-46b1-8151-01416187d91f.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026l9WoAzZeoc1789526879.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a5e84c49-c5a4-46b1-8151-01416187d91f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_7032b0f81f69fa6b-417\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_7032b0f81f69fa6b-418\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>見到心血全毀，陳曉華當場崩潰暴走，向著對方怒吼：「林醫生！你走呀你走呀！你返去做嘢！」 隨後更只能咬牙切齒地自行收拾殘局。二人鬥氣的逗趣互動曝光後，讓一眾網民捧腹大笑！</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T04:59:03.982126+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":508,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}